---
const today = new Date();
const year = today.getFullYear();
---

<footer class="border-t border-border mt-20">
	<div
		class="container py-16 flex flex-col md:flex-row md:items-end justify-between gap-10"
	>
		<div class="max-w-[420px]">
			<p
				class="text-2xl font-bold"
				style="font-family: var(--font-display)"
			>
				Oswa dev
			</p>
			<p class="text-muted-foreground mt-3">
				¿Tienes un proyecto en mente o quieres saludar? Escríbeme.
			</p>
			<a
				href="mailto:oswaldohuillca@gmail.com"
				class="inline-block mt-4 font-semibold text-brand-strong dark:text-brand hover:underline"
			>
				oswaldohuillca@gmail.com
			</a>
		</div>

		<div class="flex items-center gap-3">
			<a
				href="https://github.com/oswaldohuillca"
				target="_blank"
				rel="nofollow noopener"
				title="GitHub"
				aria-label="GitHub"
				class="flex justify-center items-center size-[46px] text-2xl rounded-lg border border-border hover:border-brand hover:text-brand-strong dark:hover:text-brand transition-colors"
			>
				<span class="icon-[ant-design--github-outlined]"></span>
			</a>
			<a
				href="/CV-Oswaldo.pdf"
				download="CV-Oswa.pdf"
				title="Descargar CV"
				aria-label="Descargar CV"
				class="flex justify-center items-center size-[46px] text-2xl rounded-lg border border-border hover:border-brand hover:text-brand-strong dark:hover:text-brand transition-colors"
			>
				<span class="icon-[iconamoon--cloud-download]"></span>
			</a>
		</div>
	</div>

	<div class="container pb-10 text-sm text-muted-foreground">
		© {year} Oswaldo Huillca. Hecho con Astro.
	</div>
</footer>
